b market.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734188567\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734188567\",\"name\":\"4. How is AI impacting data science jobs?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AI is automating routine tasks such as data cleaning and reporting while creating new roles in machine learning, NLP, and AI engineering, making data science jobs more advanced and future-ready.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734201212\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734201212\",\"name\":\"5. What are the highest-paying roles in data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Some of the highest-paying roles include data scientist, machine learning engineer, AI engineer, data architect, and data engineering roles, especially in large companies and technology-driven industries.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734215502\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734215502\",\"name\":\"6. How much can a data scientist earn in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Freshers in India can typically earn \u20b96\u201312 LPA, while experienced professionals often earn \u20b915\u201330+ LPA, depending on skills, city, company, and specialization in AI or ML.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734239736\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734239736\",\"name\":\"7. Is coding necessary for a career in data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, coding is an important part of data science because languages like Python, SQL, and R are used for data analysis, machine learning models, and automation tasks.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734246946\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734246946\",\"name\":\"8. What industries will need data scientists in the future?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Industries such as healthcare, finance, e-commerce, education, manufacturing, logistics, and IT will continue to require data scientists for analytics, forecasting, and AI-driven solutions.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734263408\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734263408\",\"name\":\"9. How long does it take to learn data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For beginners, it usually takes around 6 to 12 months to learn the basics and build projects, while mastering advanced concepts may take one to two years.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734280704\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-future\/#faq-question-1775734280704\",\"name\":\"10. Can freshers get jobs in data science?\",\"answerCount\":1,